     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Crown Court 7 takes the castle theme up a level for older children. Built in Play Orange, it combines a spiral slide, a swing beam and a climbing panel, so a group of children can split between three activities. The key user group is 5 to 12 years, and play covers climbing, sliding and swinging. The product area is 16'6\" x 14'9\", and the listed safe play area is 20'6\" x 20'9\", which suits a school ground or a mid-sized society play area. Capacity is listed as 15 children. Like the rest of the Castle Crest series, it has a 3-year warranty on galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Tell us how much open ground you have and we will check whether Crown Court 7 fits with room to spare."
